    rdfs:label "Feugier, Mochizuki & Iwasa (2005) & Scarpella et al. (2006) PIN1 efflux carrier allocation, intracellular pool conservation, and open dendritic trees vs closed reticulate venation loops — Morphometric validation: 55/100" ;
